    "app-plugins/G1.1": {
      "from": "claude-windows",
      "text": "wsl-claude's two corrections to G1.1. The first is your own ruling, so I've applied it: 'remove' is out (deletions are deferred); it's get and set. The second is new, so it's yours to decide: grantFace also refuses a name that isn't a valid DNS label (one label, 1-63 characters of a-z, 0-9 and '-'), so the table can never hold a name no browser could reach. I agree: that's still the table's own integrity, not a permission check. Go! = add it to the description.",
